<section class="aq-section"><div class="aq-in aq-stack-l"><header class="aq-sec-head"><h2 class="aq-h1">Water quality standards and where the proof sits</h2><p class="aq-lead">Proof sits in your turnover package: factory and site acceptance tests (FAT, SAT) and installation, operational and performance qualification (IQ, OQ, PQ).</p></header><div class="aq-evidence"><div class="aq-fold" id="fold-1"><table class="aq-evidence__table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Standard</th><th scope="col">What we design to</th><th scope="col">Document that proves it</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="aq-evidence__row"><th scope="row" class="aq-evidence__t"><span class="aq-evidence__n" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span class="aq-evidence__name">USP &lt;645&gt; Water conductivity</span></th><td class="aq-evidence__how">Stage 1 on the non-temperature-compensated reading; cell constant ± 2 %, instrument ± 0.1 <span class="aq-unit">µ</span>S/cm, temperature ± 2 °C</td><td class="aq-evidence__proof"><ul class="aq-evidence__docs"><li class="aq-evidence__doc"><span class="aq-evidence__file">Calibration certificates</span></li><li class="aq-evidence__doc"><span class="aq-evidence__file">FAT, SAT and OQ raw readings</span></li></ul><p class="aq-evidence__go"><a href="#sys-monitoring" data-wp="sys-monitoring">Monitoring and controls</a></p></td></tr><tr class="aq-evidence__row"><th scope="row" class="aq-evidence__t"><span class="aq-evidence__n" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span class="aq-evidence__name">USP &lt;643&gt; Total organic carbon</span></th><td class="aq-evidence__how">≤ 0.50 mg/L; system suitability against sucrose and 1,4-benzoquinone, 85–115 % response efficiency</td><td class="aq-evidence__proof"><ul class="aq-evidence__docs"><li class="aq-evidence__doc"><span class="aq-evidence__file">Suitability records</span></li><li class="aq-evidence__doc"><span class="aq-evidence__file">Analyzer calibration</span></li><li class="aq-evidence__doc"><span class="aq-evidence__file">OQ report</spa