idence__proof"><ul class="aq-evidence__docs"><li class="aq-evidence__doc"><span class="aq-evidence__file">Water grade for each point of use in the basis of design</span></li></ul><p class="aq-evidence__go"><a href="#ind-pharma" data-wp="ind-pharma">Pharmaceutical</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><button type="button" class="aq-fold__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="fold-1" data-more="Show all 8 standards">Show all 8 standards</button></div></div></div></section>
