<section class="aq-section"><div class="aq-in aq-stack-l"><header class="aq-sec-head"><h2 class="aq-h1">Where data integrity lives</h2><p class="aq-lead">Mapped to 21 CFR Part 11 and EU GMP Annex 11.</p></header><div class="aq-evidence"><div class="aq-fold" id="fold-92"><table class="aq-evidence__table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Requirement</th><th scope="col">How the controls meet it</th><th scope="col">Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="aq-evidence__row"><th scope="row" class="aq-evidence__t"><span class="aq-evidence__n" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span class="aq-evidence__name">Audit trail</span></th><td class="aq-evidence__how">Who, when, old and new value and reason; cannot be switched off</td><td class="aq-evidence__proof"><ul class="aq-evidence__docs aq-evidence__refs"><li class="aq-evidence__doc is-ref"><span class="aq-evidence__rk">21 CFR Part 11</span><span class="aq-evidence__clause">11.10(e)</span></li><li class="aq-evidence__doc is-ref"><span class="aq-evidence__rk">EU GMP Annex 11</span><span class="aq-evidence__clause">9</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr class="aq-evidence__row"><th scope="row" class="aq-evidence__t"><span class="aq-evidence__n" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span class="aq-evidence__name">Access control</span></th><td class="aq-evidence__how">Individual accounts, role-based rights, automatic logout; each role tested at FAT</td><td class="aq-evidence__proof"><ul class="aq-evidence__docs aq-evidence__refs"><li class="aq-evidence__doc is-ref"><span class="aq-evidence__rk">21 CFR Part 11</span><span class="aq-evidence__clause">11.10(d), (g)</span></li><li class="aq-evidence__doc is-ref"><span class="aq-evidence__rk">EU GMP Annex 11</span><span class="aq-evidence__clause">12</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr class="aq-evidence__row"><th scope="row" class="aq-evidence__t"><span class="aq-evidence__n" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span class="aq-evidence__name">Electronic signatures</span></th><td class="aq-evidence__how">Signer, time and 